INGS.QTRLY EPS $0.49.ON APRIL 24, CO ISSUED $1.2 BILLION AGGREGATE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF 6.875% NOTES DUE 2025.'}{'symbol': 'HII', 'date': '2020-05-05 13:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Huntington Ingalls Industries Awarded $187 Million Advance Procurement Contract For Amphibious Assault Ship Lha 9', 'text': 'HUNTINGTON INGALLS INDUSTRIES AWARDED $187 MILLION ADVANCE PROCUREMENT CONTRACT FOR AMPHIBIOUS ASSAULT SHIP LHA 9.HUNTINGTON INGALLS INDUSTRIES SAYS ITS INGALLS SHIPBUILDING DIVISION HAS RECEIVED A $187.46 MILLION ADVANCE PROCUREMENT CONTRACT FROM U.S. NAVY.'}{'symbol': 'ITW', 'date': '2020-05-05 11:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'ITW Reports Q1 Revenue Of $3.2 Bln', 'text': 'REPORTS FIRST QUARTER 2020 RESULTS.Q1 GAAP EARNINGS PER SHARE $1.77.Q1 REVENUE $3.2 BILLION VERSUS REFINITIV IBES ESTIMATE OF $3.29 BILLION.Q1 EARNINGS PER SHARE ESTIMATE $1.71 -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.ILLINOIS TOOL WORKS INC - SUSPENDING PREVIOUSLY ANNOUNCED ANNUAL GUIDANCE FOR 2020.'}{'symbol': 'INCY', 'date': '2020-05-05 09:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Incyte Reports Q1 Loss Per Share Of $3.33', 'text': 'INCYTE REPORTS 2020 FIRST QUARTER FINANCIAL RESULTS AND PROVIDES UPDATES ON KEY CLINICAL PROGRAMS.INCYTE CORP - TOTAL PRODUCT AND ROYALTY REVENUES OF $569 MILLION FOR QUARTER.INCYTE CORP - RUXOLITINIB AND BARICITINIB IN CLINICAL TRIALS TO TREAT PATIENTS SUFFERING FROM COVID-19.INCYTE CORP - QTRLY LOSS PER SHARE $3.33.INCYTE CORP - QTRLY ADJUSTED LOSS PER SHARE $2.86.INCYTE CORP - SEES 2020 JAKAFI NET PRODUCT REVENUES $1.88 BILLION - $1.95 BILLION.INCYTE CORP - SEES 2020 ICLUSIG NET PRODUCT REVENUES $100 MILLION - $105 MILLION.'}{'symbol': 'IPGP', 'date': '2020-05-05 10:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'IPG Photonics Reports Q1 EPS Of $0.68', 'text': 'IPG PHOTONICS ANNOUNCES FIRST QUARTER 2020 FINANCIAL RESULTS.Q1 EARNINGS PER SHARE $0.68.Q1 REVENUE $249 MILLION VERSUS REFINITIV IBES ESTIMATE OF $231.9 MILLION.Q1 EARNINGS PER SHARE ESTIMATE $0.19 -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.SEES Q2 2020 REVENUE $260 MILLION TO $290 MILLION.FOR